// # openOODA Website — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Public website and interactive demo for openOODA.
//
// Setup: Static site served from GitHub Pages at openooda.org.
//
// Beats:
//   1. index.html — single-page app shell.
//   2. 404.html — not found page.
//   3. src/main.js — the SPA and dogfight simulator.
//   4. styles/main.css — theme and layout.
//   5. assets/favicon.svg — browser tab icon.
//   6. assets/open-graph.png — social card image.
//   7. wasm/site.wasm — the compiled WebAssembly runtime.
//   8. sitemap.xml and robots.txt — crawler metadata.
//   9. llms.txt and llms-full.txt — public LLM context.
//  10. scripts/site_*.oo — pure .oo build pipeline (build, template, routes, markdown, minify, highlight, inline, sync_appjs, build_fresh).
//  11. Sub-menu: 8 polyrepo repos in first-principles order — ooda, std, opm, cli, lsp, mcp; oodac + runtime as "coming soon" pending gemini's extraction from oda/.
